{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_b6d763ccb39ff75f-407\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>熱播中的劇集《死有對証》17日一集迎來新進展！劇中郭耀慶（陳少邦飾）涉嫌殺害太太章蓉蓉（張詩欣飾）的案件有突破性發展，其中張詩欣留給父親的最後遺言影片，更是深深引起一眾網民留意。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_b6d763ccb39ff75f-408\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>劇情講到芷昕（陳曉華飾）在林琛（韋家雄飾）的指導下完成解剖，確認死者章蓉蓉因同時服用抗凝血藥物及抗抑鬱藥導致腦中風死亡。警方隨後在耀慶的車上找到抗凝血藥物，因而指控他蓄意令死者誤服。然而芷昕其後找到新線索，揭發真相其實是蓉蓉生前長期飽受耀慶家暴，最終在絕望下服藥自殺，並刻意佈局嫁禍給老公！</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_b6d763ccb39ff75f-409\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>蓉蓉的父親看到女兒留下的最後遺言，片中蓉蓉一副生無可戀的樣子，痛心說道：「自從畀個衰人打到小產後，醫生話我唔可以再生，阿爸對唔住呀！我受夠喇！我真係好痛苦，唔想再留喺呢個世界上面。」隨後眼神更流露出對丈夫極致的憎恨：「但我唔會就咁死益咗個衰人，佢一定會罪有應得㗎，一定會呀！」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_b6d763ccb39ff75f-410\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"beb6bce5-5bcd-4eb2-ba01-63b7159b0a71.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026V9D76uKdAY1789721203.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"beb6bce5-5bcd-4eb2-ba01-63b7159b0a71.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cf1fcedb-45c4-44ee-9ab6-05e13b74512d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026UGbTfeQPUN1789721203.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cf1fcedb-45c4-44ee-9ab6-05e13b74512d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_b6d763ccb39ff75f-410\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_b6d763ccb39ff75f-410\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>雖然張詩欣在劇中出現的場口不多，惟短短幾句對白，已成功將受盡屈辱、至死都不肯放過對方的痛恨演得淋漓盡致。一班網民紛紛留言大讚：「佢咪就係李莫仇！冇戴眼鏡差啲唔認得佢」、「詩欣做得幾好，同李莫仇又好唔同」、「佢之前演癱瘓女騎師都做得好好。」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_b6d763ccb39ff75f-410\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ab9f5c44-520d-49fe-a01c-831538f8f670.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026TzkqOQmDdu1789721202.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ab9f5c44-520d-49fe-a01c-831538f8f670.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_b6d763ccb39ff75f-411\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>張詩欣於 2014 年參加第 27 期無綫電視藝員訓練班入行，多年來參演過不少劇集，雖以飾演閒角為主，但其中在《愛·回家之開心速遞》演「李莫仇」，與周嘉洛和吳偉豪有不少搞笑對手戲而為人熟悉。另外，她先前亦曾在《再見‧枕邊人》中飾演癱瘓女騎師，同樣令人留下深刻印象。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-18T09:13:52.831018+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":627,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}